            "is_free": true,
            "detailed_description": "<strong>Earth is under siege!</strong><br>\t\t\t\t\tA mysterious and powerful alien race has come to enslave the entire galaxy, and your fleet is humanity's last hope. You must put an end to the attacks and rebuild a home for the survivors. With the invaders in hot pursuit, and the dangers of the unexplored at every turn, do you have what it takes to forge a new galaxy?<br>\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Team up with up to 4 players and explore the galaxy. <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Enjoy challenging action, smart puzzles, and deep adventure. <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Customize your ship with a huge selection of parts. <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Use physics to solve puzzles or defeat your enemies.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Create your own galaxy using the built in editor. <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Download new galaxies from other players for endless gameplay. </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Proto Defense DLC</h2>\t\t\t\t\tSource Studio is pleased to announce it's first Arcade map: Proto Defense!<br>\t\t\t\t\tProto Defense is the first online multiplayer co-op turret defense game for ProtoGalaxy. Team up with your friends to defend Earth from alien invaders in this unique turret defense experience.<br>\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Team up to defend Earth from alien invaders.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Pick from a big selection of turrets.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Reposition your turrets at any time to deal extra damage.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Take down huge bosses.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Compete in leaderboards for the highest score.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Tackle 8 new challenging achievements.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Built using the ProtoGalaxy Editor.M</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<strong>Earth is under siege!</strong><br>\t\t\t\t\tA mysterious and powerful alien race has come to enslave the entire galaxy, and your fleet is humanity's last hope. You must put an end to the attacks and rebuild a home for the survivors. With the invaders in hot pursuit, and the dangers of the unexplored at every turn, do you have what it takes to forge a new galaxy?<br>\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Team up with up to 4 players and explore the galaxy. <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Enjoy challenging action, smart puzzles, and deep adventure. <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Customize your ship with a huge selection of parts. <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Use physics to solve puzzles or defeat your enemies.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Create your own galaxy using the built in editor. <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Download new galaxies from other players for endless gameplay. </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Proto Defense DLC</h2>\t\t\t\t\tSource Studio is pleased to announce it's first Arcade map: Proto Defense!<br>\t\t\t\t\tProto Defense is the first online multiplayer co-op turret defense game for ProtoGalaxy. Team up with your friends to defend Earth from alien invaders in this unique turret defense experience.<br>\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Team up to defend Earth from alien invaders.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Pick from a big selection of turrets.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Reposition your turrets at any time to deal extra damage.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Take down huge bosses.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Compete in leaderboards for the highest score.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Tackle 8 new challenging achievements.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Built using the ProtoGalaxy Editor.M</li></ul>",
